    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game transports players into a wondrous world filled with challenges and adventures, starring a particularly charming bird wearing a hat. Players use the ASDW keys to control the bird\u2019s movements and the space bar to initiate attacks. On this oceanic journey, the bird must face a myriad of obstacles and traps, from sharp rocks to suddenly appearing monsters, each challenge demanding the player\u2019s utmost attention. The game features vibrant and lifelike visuals, vividly portraying the vastness and beauty of the ocean, as well as the dangers along the way. The background music is light and cheerful, but the tempo quickens as the bird approaches danger, heightening the tension. Specific sound effects accompany a game-over situation, alerting players to be more cautious. This game not only tests the player\u2019s reaction speed and operational skills but also offers a feast for the eyes and ears.</p>",
